    "chapter": 5,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "都说了\n\n丽丽：我们周六去吃饭吧！小雨说，有一家饭店很好吃。\n小何：周六我要工作。\n丽丽：我等你。\n小何：我很忙，会工作到很晚。\n丽丽：没关系，我等你。\n小何：我真的很忙，你和小雨去吧。\n丽丽：我想和你去啊。\n小何：都说了我很忙，我不想去。\n丽丽：哦，我知道了。",
    "traditional": "都說了\n\n麗麗：我們週六去吃飯吧！小雨說，有一家飯店很好吃。\n小何：週六我要工作。\n麗麗：我等你。\n小何：我很忙，會工作到很晚。\n麗麗：沒關係，我等你。\n小何：我真的很忙，你和小雨去吧。\n麗麗：我想和你去啊。\n小何：都說了我很忙，我不想去。\n麗麗：哦，我知道了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Already Told You"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我们周六去吃饭吧！小雨说，有一家饭店很好吃。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我們週六去吃飯吧！小雨說，有一家飯店很好吃。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ men zhōu liù qù chī fàn ba xiǎo yǔ shuō yǒu yì jiā fàn diàn hěn hǎo chī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Let’s go have a meal on Saturday! Little Yu says there’s a delicious restaurant."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：周六我要工作。",
      "traditional": "小何：週六我要工作。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zhōu liù wǒ yào gōng zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I have to work on Saturday."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我等你。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我等你。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ děng nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I’ll wait for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：我很忙，会工作到很晚。",
      "traditional": "小何：我很忙，會工作到很晚。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ hěn máng huì gōng zuò dào hěn wǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I’m really busy. I have to work until late."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：没关系，我等你。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：沒關係，我等你。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì méi guān xi wǒ děng nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: That’s ok, I’ll wait for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：我真的很忙，你和小雨去吧。",
      "traditional": "小何：我真的很忙，你和小雨去吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ zhēn de hěn máng nǐ hé xiǎo yǔ qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I really am busy. Why don’t you go with Little Yu."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我想和你去啊。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我想和你去啊。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ xiǎng hé nǐ qù a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I want to go with you."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小何：都说了我很忙，我不想去。",
      "traditional": "小何：都說了我很忙，我不想去。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé dōu shuō le wǒ hěn máng wǒ bù xiǎng qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I already told you I’m busy. I don’t want to go."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哦，我知道了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哦，我知道了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì ò wǒ zhī dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Oh… Got it."
    }
